To check if someone else is doing/has done the same task, just check
the KJ patch set and the recent archives to see if there is a patch
for the file/files you are wanting to change, or to see if someone is
doing a series of similar patches.

Also if you are going to expend any kind of effort on a task, you
might like to send an email in asking if it would be
accepted/appreciated, cc'ing it to the appropriate maintainer/list,
who might not want the fix, or already have a fix queued up.

